&lt;li&gt;Hold the promotion plans for creatives in their team (subject to approval and sign off by management team)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set objectives and performance goals for the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely alongside other creative directors (including design director)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance hands on vs oversight of projects effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the ECD to build processes, structures and raise the quality of creative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nurture and build a team of happy and fulfilled creatives&lt;/li&gt;
